 InterestPrint® Women's Vest Shorts Pajama Set (Model Sets 33) 
 Type: 100% Polyester, Two Pieces, All Over Printing 
 Made of 100% high-quality polyester, soft and comfortable.
 Featuring a round-neck tank top design, the adjustable waistband with a drawstring provides a better fit for your body.
 The trim on the top and the drawstring on the pants are made from randomly selected patterns from the design drawing and cannot be customized.
 Perfect for casual, everyday wear, offering both comfort and flexibility.
 Size: S, M, L, XL, 2XL, 3XL, 4XL. Calculate your size from the measurement chart below please.
 Note: This product is printed and shipped out from our USA-based factory. When you place the order, please separate products made in USA to speed up the whole processing.
 Designer tip: To ensure the highest quality print, please note that this product's recommended uploaded image size in pixels (W x H): 
Front: 3294 x 3831 or Higher / 150 dpi;
Back: 3256 x 3771 or Higher / 150 dpi;
Pants front: 3722 x 2649 or Higher / 150 dpi;
Pants back: 4123 x 2899 or Higher / 150 dpi.
 CUSTOMIZATION TIPS 
 We can't guarantee exact placement. There might be slight discrepancies in print placement. Please keep the main elements of your art towards the center of the design area. Anything near the edge runs the risk of being cut off during the cutting and sewing process.
