 Type: Flannel, for Men, All Over Printing 
 32.31 oz. Made from high-quality flannel, warm and soft.
 Features an adjustable waist belt that assists in securely closing the robe from the front so that you can wear it confidently.
 The two front pockets give you the option of keeping frequently used items in it when they’re worn for a good part of the day.
 Perfect for lounging and relaxation after a long day at work.
