 InterestPrint® Women's Mary Jane Shoes 
 Type: Polyester + EVA Sole, All Over Printing 
 10.23 oz. Made of the EVA sole and mesh upper material, breathable and lightweight.
 Featuring a Velcro closure, these shoes are easy to put on and take off, providing convenience and comfort.
 Crafted with a lightweight EVA sole for superior cushioning and durability, paired with a breathable, flexible mesh upper for optimal comfort, ventilation, and a snug fit.
 The outsole and bias binding are available in white and black.
 This product does not come with a shoebox.
 Perfect for casual outings, office wear, and semi-formal events, offering both comfort and style.
 Logo tag cannot be added to this product.
 Sizes: 35, 36, 37, 38, 39, 40, 41. Please calculate your size from the measurement chart below.
